message: >-
  If you use GETELEC, please cite the software as below, and the papers listed
  under references.
type: software
title: "GETELEC: General Tool for Electron Emission Calculations"
abstract: >-
  Thermal-field electron emission current density, energy distributions and
  Nottingham heat for metallic and semiconducting emitters, with a graphical
  interface for calculations and fitting.
